# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF (21 Oct 2026).
# Everything runs in Linux containers, and a mix of CRLF (Windows editors) and LF
# made whole files show as changed when one editor saved over another's.
# Windows editors handle LF fine; git converts nothing else.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these: binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
